The exact DSATUR attack is failing all tested shipping seeds as intended, but the complete self-test is taking longer than expected. I’m letting this run finish once so I can identify the actual hotspot from its measurements; if it is merely the 200k structure-aware sampler, I’ll preserve the required sample count and optimize its representation rather than weaken the gate.
