+        "the shipping balanced q=4, a=0, b=12 planted model (n=240, expected "
+        "degree 9, SNR=1) at the boundary rather than in its SNR>1 efficient "
+        "recovery regime; measured DSATUR and spectral recovery costs are in G5."
