Before I freeze the README, I’m adding one more construction-aware check beyond the mandatory panel: min-conflicts/Walk-COL. Sparse planted colorings can defeat adjacency spectral recovery yet still collapse under local repair; that would invalidate Track A even though the current five attacks pass. If it succeeds, I’ll treat the family as broken rather than burying it in caveats.
